		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">TwinSAFE logic terminal, no field terminals and no terminal drawn. Power contacts (24 V / 0 V) drawn as the pass-through of the series: ASSUMED, the datasheet gives "current consumption power contacts: -".</elementInformation>
